## Character [/api/characters/{id}]
A single character object with all its details.

+ Parameters
    + id (required, number, `1`) ... Numeric `id` of the Character to perform action with. Has example value.

### Retrieve a Character [GET]
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Header

            X-My-Header: The Value

    + Body
    
            {"character_id" : 1,
            "character_firstname" : "Robert",
            "character_lastname" : "Baratheon",
            "character_gender" : "Male",
            "character_religion": "Faith of the Seven",
            "character_status": "Deceased",
            "description”: "King of the Seven Kingdoms his untimely death."}
            }
            
+ Response 404 (application/json)

    + Header

            X-My-Header: The Value

    + Body

            {"message":"error", "errors":["not found"]}

## Event Collection [/api/events]
The list of events.

