## Event [/api/event/{id}]
Manipulation of an individual event. It may be nicer to route based on the
event name instead of the event id.

+ Parameters
    + id (required, number, `1`) ... Numeric `id` of the Character to perform action with. Has example value.

### List an Event [GET]
Get details about the event denoted by {id}.

+ Response 200

    + Header

            X-My-Header : The Value

    + Body
    
            {"event_id" : 1,
            "event_name" : "The Battle of Blackwater Bay",
            "event_type" : "battle",
            "location_id" : 7 
            }
            
+ Response 404 (application/json)

    + Header

            X-My-Header: The Value

    + Body

            {"message":"error", "errors":["not found"]}

